{"title":"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/3/de3dedca26a625ee5e2dbb22524558c2d3fac374.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + \\frac{y}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"33\" /> are not zero, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/a/bfad0eae753d6f61983a0b2fa11e6c2a70e13949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( 2x + \\frac{y}{2} \\right)^{-1} \\left[(2x)^{-1} + \\left( \\frac{y}{2} \\right)^{-1} \\right]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"238\" height=\"43\" />\nequals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/2/a02f5d77501d111ad1341bc2dadd006180f457c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }xy^{-1}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }x^{-1}y\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }(xy)^{-1}\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"542\" height=\"21\" /> \n</p><p><br />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/f/96ff573cdc0345f8ec5c6bdc4dde5c69c192f9f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left( 2x+ \\frac{y}{2} \\right)^{-1} = \\left( \\frac{4x+y}{2} \\right)^{-1} = \\frac{2}{4x+y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"299\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>Then, the expression simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/d/3dd67fbdc5bcf3fbd6f02bdc5cf6bd85c58c9caf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left( 2x + \\frac{y}{2} \\right)^{-1} \\left[(2x)^{-1} + \\left( \\frac{y}{2} \\right)^{-1} \\right] \\Rightarrow \\frac{2}{4x+y} \\left( \\frac{1}{2x} + \\frac{2}{y} \\right) \\Rightarrow \\frac{2}{4x+y} \\left( \\frac{y+4x}{2xy} \\right) \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{xy}.\\]\" width=\"635\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d02e04185f679f915096ce5eff1d654f48f782.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) }(xy)^{-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"90\" height=\"21\" />. ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Jiang147369\" title=\"User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME\" title=\"1977 AHSME\">1977 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1977 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1977\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1977 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit